Package: ivue
Title: Interactive 3D Visualization of Data and Graphs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pawel", "Gajer", email = "pgajer@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates interactive three-dimensional point clouds and embedded
    weighted graphs with numerical or categorical annotations.
    Provides reusable continuous and categorical color scales, matching
    legends, highlighting, and geometric edge, path, and label layers.
    Supports multiple weighted-graph formats and optional layouts through
    'igraph', with explicit distance or strength weight semantics. Renders
    browser widgets using 'rgl' without requiring a native graphics window.
License: GPL (>= 3)
